# Generated by scripts/gen-flag-docs.py from koboldcpp.py 1.122.1. Don't edit by hand.
---

These flags are hidden from `--help`. They still parse so that old commands and `.kcpps` files keep working; some still have an effect, others are ignored. Use the replacement listed for each.

## Deprecated

### `--hordeconfig` {% #hordeconfig %}

Value: `value`

Deprecated: sets several Horde worker options at once.

Use instead: `--hordemodelname`, `--hordegenlen`, `--hordemaxctx`, `--hordekey` and `--hordeworkername`. Still works and overrides those flags; the key and worker name are only taken when all five values are given.

### `--sdconfig` {% #sdconfig %}

Value: `value`

Deprecated: sets the image model and some image options at once.

Use instead: `--sdmodel`, `--sdclamped`, `--sdthreads` and `--sdquant`. Still works.

### `--noblas` {% #noblas %}

Deprecated: runs on the CPU only.

Use instead: `--usecpu`. Still works.

### `--nommap` {% #nommap %}

Also: `--no-mmap`

Deprecated: turned off memory mapping.

Use instead: Nothing needed: mmap is now off by default; use `--usemmap` to turn it on. Has no effect.

### `--nopipelineparallel` {% #nopipelineparallel %}

Deprecated: turned off pipeline parallelism across GPUs.

Use instead: Nothing: pipeline parallelism is now automatic. Has no effect.

### `--pipelineparallel` {% #pipelineparallel %}

Deprecated: turned on pipeline parallelism across GPUs.

Use instead: Nothing: pipeline parallelism is now automatic. Has no effect.

### `--sdnotile` {% #sdnotile %}

Deprecated: turned off VAE tiling for image generation.

Use instead: `--sdtiledvae 0`. Has no effect on the command line; only old `.kcpps` files that lack `sdtiledvae` still apply it.

### `--sdt5xxl` {% #sdt5xxl %}

Value: `[filename]`

Deprecated: the T5-XXL text encoder for image models.

Use instead: `--sdllm`. Still works when `--sdllm` is not set.

### `--sdvaecpu` {% #sdvaecpu %}

Deprecated: ran the image VAE on the CPU.

Use instead: `--sdvaedevice CPU`. Still works when `--sdvaedevice` is not set.

### `--sdclipgpu` {% #sdclipgpu %}

Deprecated: ran the image text encoders on the GPU.

Use instead: `--sdclipdevice main`. Still works when `--sdclipdevice` is not set.

### `--forceversion` {% #forceversion %}

Deprecated: forced a model format version.

Use instead: Nothing. Has no effect.

### `--sdgendefaults` {% #sdgendefaults %}

Deprecated: default parameters for image generation requests.

Use instead: `--gendefaults`. The command-line flag has no effect; in an old config without `gendefaults`, its value is carried over.

### `--flashattention` {% #flashattention %}

Also: `--flash-attn`, `-fa`

Deprecated: turned on flash attention.

The `-fa` alias is still accepted, so llama.cpp-style command lines do not fail.

Use instead: Nothing needed: flash attention is on by default; use `--noflashattention` to turn it off. Has no effect on the command line, but an old `.kcpps` with `flashattention` set to false turns flash attention off.

### `--useswa` {% #useswa %}

Deprecated: turned on sliding-window attention (SWA).

Use instead: Nothing needed: SWA is on by default; use `--noswa` to turn it off. Has no effect on the command line, but an old `.kcpps` with `useswa` set to false turns SWA off.
